- tech-stack.md (technologies)
- PR analysis (patterns from git history)
- Starter templates (generic conventions)

To include file analysis:
- Provide file paths or glob patterns
- Example: src/components/**/*.tsx
\`\`\`

### Files Not Found
\`\`\`markdown
